CM phased vertical dipoles
CM
CM phased array of vertical dipoles
CM
CE
SY lower=1.0
SY upper=lower+10.2
GW 1,21,0,0,lower,0,0,upper,1in
SY theta=-90
SY mag=1.0
SY sep=5.5
GW 2,21,sep,0,lower,sep,0,upper,1in
! freespace() ;
GE 0
EX 1,1,11,0,1,0
EX 1,2,11,0,mag*cos(theta),mag*sin(theta)
RP 0,1,360,1000,75,0,0,1
GN -1
FR 0,1,0,0,14,0
RP 0,37,73,1000,0,0,5,5
EN
